    "description": "<p>At the beginning of each session, roll your <strong>Resonance Dice</strong> and place them on this card. Each die may only be spent once.</p><p>You may spend a Resonance Die to either:</p><ul><li><p>Add its value to an Attack Roll.</p></li><li><p>Add its value to a Damage Roll.</p></li><li><p>Spend 1 Hope to clear 1 Hit Point on a creature within Close range.</p></li></ul><p>All Resonance Dice are reset and restored at the beginning of the session. The number of <strong>Resonance Dice</strong> you roll depends on your Tier:</p><table><thead><tr><th><p>Tier</p></th><th><p>Resonance Dice</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>3d6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>4d6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>5d6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>6d6</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
